During their bye , the Eagles signed former Giants offensive tackle Will Beatty and former Saints linebacker Dannell Ellerbe to not only add depth but also players with Super Bowl experiences . Coming off of the bye week , the Philadelphia Eagles entered a Sunday night showdown with the defending NFC East champion Dallas Cowboys . The Eagles came out sluggish and trailed 9 -- 7 at the half . The team exploded in the second half though , rattling off 30 unanswered points to soundly defeat their rival by a final score of 37 -- 9 . The Eagles were rolling on a nine - game winning streak after a huge blowout win over the Chicago Bears . The Eagles traveled to Seattle in Week 13 in a huge Sunday Night showdown against Russell Wilson and the Seattle Seahawks . The Eagles struggled throughout the whole game , blowing many scoring opportunities and allowing Wilson to throw 3 touchdowns . The Eagles lost 24 -- 10 , ending their win streak . However , the Eagles bounced back in Week 14 win over the Los Angeles Rams in a tough 43 -- 35 win . However , Carson Wentz left the game in the third quarter with a knee injury .","entities":["Los Angeles Rams","Chicago Bears","Carson Wentz","Will Beatty","Dannell Ellerbe","Saints","Eagles-Cowboys game","Eagles-Bears game","Russell Wilson","Seattle","Eagles-Seahawks game","Eagles-Rams game","Giants","Dallas Cowboys","Philadelphia Eagles"],"facts":["Los Angeles Rams -PARTICIPATED_IN-> 1949 NFL championship","Los Angeles Rams -MEMBER_OF-> NFC West","Los Angeles Rams -PART_OF-> NFL","Chicago Bears -MEMBER_OF-> NFC North","Buddy Ryan -WORKS_FOR-> Chicago Bears"]}
